---
layout: null
permalink: /blog/posts.json
---
{%- comment -%}
Machine-readable manifest of every post. This is the ONLY contract between the
blog content and the fractal engine in index.html: index.html fetches this file
and turns each entry into a card. Drop the fractal and the blog still works;
drop the blog and the fractal still works.
{%- endcomment -%}
{
  "generated": {{ site.time | date_to_xmlschema | jsonify }},
  "posts": [
{%- for post in site.posts %}
    {
      "title": {{ post.title | jsonify }},
      "url": {{ post.url | relative_url | jsonify }},
      "date": {{ post.date | date: "%Y-%m-%d" | jsonify }},
      "dateDisplay": {{ post.date | date: "%B %-d, %Y" | jsonify }},
      "topics": {{ post.categories | jsonify }},
      "topicPath": {{ post.categories | join: "/" | jsonify }},
      "excerpt": {{ post.excerpt | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | strip | truncate: 240 | jsonify }},
      "image": {% if post.image %}{{ post.image | relative_url | jsonify }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
      "readingTime": {% include reading-time.html content=post.content %}
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
{%- endfor %}
  ]
}
